Simple Schematics can read the .litematic container format so that existing
Litematica and Forgematica libraries can be imported. The reader in
`schematic/LitematicImporter.java` and `schematic/LitematicBitArray.java` was
written from a description of the on disk layout. No source code from
Litematica or any related project is included or derived here, and this mod is
not affiliated with or endorsed by those projects or by Mojang Studios.
